species-name-uma = Uma
species-description-uma = Uma-musume are human-like people with equine ears and a horse tail. Their body proportions and height are comparable to ordinary humans rather than the shorter Felinids.

uma-diet-poisoned = You feel your Uma physiology react badly to that food!
uma-diet-examine = Umas prefer hay, grass, oats and other grains, with small portions of safe fruits and vegetables. Some foods are poisonous to them.
